<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 35.0 bln rupees at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 35.0 bln rupees at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it raised 35.0 billion rupees through a repo auction on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cut-off rate at the auction was steady at 3.60 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
